  "borrowingRules": [
    "prepared.exactField and prepared.archimedean are borrowed read-only and must outlive every private stage invocation",
    "mutable owners may be borrowed only synchronously by a later stage and may not escape that stage",
    "a retry discards or rolls back every owner first created after its target stage",
    "precision replacement is publish-on-success and may not mutate the last accepted archimedean owner",
    "final.neutralEnvelope contains canonical copies or hashes and never borrows mutable storage",
    "only the final stage may publish; every earlier stage is private and transaction-local"
  ],
